Copies
------

These files are kept as copies, with their upstream headers and
licences, not rewritten:

  crates/mach-mig-sys/mig/defs/, crates/mach-mig-sys/mig/srv/ and
  crates/mach-mig-sys/mig/cli/
      GNU Mach's MIG interface definitions, which GNU MIG compiles at
      the MIG seam. Five are modified, each saying so at its top:
      mach/mach4.defs, mach/mach_host.defs, mach/mach_types.defs,
      mach/machine/machine_types.defs and
      mach_debug/mach_debug.defs.

  crates/mach/ldscript
      GNU Mach's x86_64 linker script, byte-identical.

  abi-test/x86_64.tar.gz
      GNU Mach's test suite, built from its abi-tests branch at
      commit 2fbf950f, with ABI tests added, frozen as binaries.
